The magnetic field at centre $O$ for each semicircular parts each of radius $R$,
$$
\mathrm{B}_1=\mathrm{B}_2=\frac{\mu_0 \mathrm{i}}{4 \mathrm{R}}
$$
The magnetic field at their common centre
$$
\begin{aligned}
\overrightarrow{\mathrm{B}} & =\overrightarrow{\mathrm{B}}_1+\overrightarrow{\mathrm{B}}_2 \\
